Got it.

53
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:04,831
What do I need to remember?

54
00:04:05,367 --> 00:04:09,896
Create empty repositories when you will push an existing project.

55
00:04:10,433 --> 00:04:15,953
gh repo create does the same as the web form; names are unique per owner.

56
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:20,500
Organisations and templates are the usual way in teams.

57
00:04:22,233 --> 00:04:25,498
How does connecting local Git to GitHub work?

58
00:04:26,033 --> 00:04:32,494
How to push an existing local repository into the empty GitHub repository from lesson 45:

59
00:04:32,494 --> 00:04:35,035
add the remote, push with upstream.

60
00:04:35,035 --> 00:04:41,713
Exactly what GitHub's "…or push an existing repository from the command line" box tells you.

61
